<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Capital One off reco list.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Capital One off reco list.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette said it removed Capital One Financial Corp from recommended list, but still rates the stock as a buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Capital One lost 1-1/2 to 31-3/4.</p>
</text>
